% Michel (relativistic Bondi) accretion onto a Schwarzschild black hole (GR_Spin = 0) in Kerr-Schild coordinates (Lupi 2023).
% 2.7e5 equal-mass cells between 4M and 100M; cells inside 1.05 horizon radii are excised. Geometric units (G = c = 1), M = 1.
% TimeMax = 30 is the short regression run of the test problem. For the science comparison (Lupi 2023) run to TimeMax = 200,
% about 7 times the cost: the inner flow (r < 6) has then relaxed from the initial conditions, which start empty inside r ~ 4.
InitCondFile                       grhd_michel_ics
ICFormat                           3
OutputDir                          output
TimeLimitCPU                       3600
PartAllocFactor                    2.0
TimeBegin                          0
TimeMax                            30
ComovingIntegrationOn              0
BoxSize                            0
OutputListOn                       0
TimeOfFirstSnapshot                0
TimeBetSnapshot                    10
MaxSizeTimestep                    0.5
MinSizeTimestep                    1e-12
DesNumNgb                          32
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 0.5
UnitMass_in_g                      1
SofteningGas                       0.001
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.01
CourantFac                         0.2
TimeBetStatistics                  0.01
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.125
ErrTolTheta                        0.7
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.0025
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
GR_Mass                            1.0
GR_Spin                            0.0
